    <string name="howto_sudoku">Fill the grid so that every row, every column and every 3×3 box has the numbers 1 to 9 exactly once.</string>
    <string name="howto_solitaire">Klondike. Build four piles from Ace to King, one per suit. Tap a card to move it to the best place.</string>
    <string name="howto_buraco">Make sequences of the same suit with your cards against the computer. Twos are wild. Seven cards make a canasta.</string>
    <string name="howto_backgammon">Roll the dice and move all your light checkers home, then bear them off before the computer does.</string>
    <string name="howto_mahjong">Remove pairs of matching tiles. A tile can be taken when nothing is on top of it and its left or right side is free.</string>
    <string name="howto_reversi">Place a disc so that you trap the computer\'s discs between two of yours: they turn to your color. Most discs wins.</string>
    <string name="howto_crossword">Read the clue and fill in the word. Tap a square to choose a word, tap again to change direction.</string>
    <string name="howto_pipes">Tap the pieces to turn them until every pipe is connected to the water source with no open ends.</string>
    <string name="howto_connect">Draw a line between dots of the same color. Lines cannot cross. Try to fill the whole board.</string>
    <string name="howto_dots">Drag across neighboring dots of the same color to clear them. Close a square to clear every dot of that color.</string>

